WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.489 --> 00:00:05.680
Shireen Baratheon: The Dance of Dragons.&nbsp;
It's the story of the fight between Rhaenyra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.720
Targaryen and her half-brother Aegon&nbsp;
for control of the Seven Kingdoms. 
&nbsp;

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.040
A True Telling by Grand Maester Munkun,&nbsp;
being a history of the war of Targaryen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.520
succession between the Princess Rhaenyra&nbsp;
and Aegon, Second of his name, that nearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.320
destroyed the realm.
Viserys Targaryen:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.880
One night, a servant found the old king&nbsp;
had died in his sleep. Protocol dictated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.440
that the bells would be rung and a raven sent to&nbsp;
Dragonstone to summon the heir, Princess Rhaenyra,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.840
for her coronation. But Alicent had other plans.
Ser Otto Hightower, the Hand of the King and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.840
father to Queen Alicent, demanded that&nbsp;
the succession be settled immediately. 
&nbsp;

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:49.200
The old king had forced the lords of Westeros to&nbsp;
swear fealty to Princess Rhaenyra as his heir.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.280
But Ser Criston Cole rightly&nbsp;
pointed out that a son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.840
comes before a daughter.
Shireen:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:06.160
Both of them thought they belonged on the Iron&nbsp;
Throne. When people started declaring for one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:10.640
them or the other, their fight divided the&nbsp;
kingdoms in two. Brothers fought brothers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:20.080
dragons fought dragons. By the time it was over,&nbsp;
thousands were dead. And it was a disaster for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:26.840
Targaryens as well. They never truly recovered.
Varys:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.920
During the great Targaryen civil war known&nbsp;
as "the Dance of the Dragons," a king and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:41.280
queen each vied for the throne, dividing their&nbsp;
house and its dragons against each other. 
&nbsp;

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:46.240
Eventually, the queen was fed to her rival's&nbsp;
dragons while her son watched, and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:52.560
victorious king soon died of his own wounds.
By the war's end, King's Landing was smashed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.560 --> 00:02:04.960
cities razed and sacked never to be rebuilt,&nbsp;
and dragons had faded from this world.

